    "body": "> I'm guessing because it's pulling from interestfor directory? Perhaps there's a better place to put shared utils. I suspect there's a bit of duplicatyion between command-and-commandfor, interestfor, popover and now this.\n\nYeah, it would be a great refactor to pull some of those to common directories, but I'd argue that's going to just be a rename/move. There are cross-directory references like this all over the WPT repo, and in my view, as long as they're not broken, it's not really hurting anything other than discovery. (The WPT runner knows how to operate a `../../` path.) Of course, I'm not against moving things around to be better organized.",
